  "description": "Beasley is made of rust proof 6000 series alloy in a low frame stand-over height and available in either 24\" or 26\" wheel sizes (see Beasley 26), Beasley features a no-nonsense rigid 6000 series alloy fork, a 7-speed 1X drive train with Shimano Revo Shifters, which adds versatility and simplicity. The Pivit alloy cassette 32-hole hubs set is laced to sturdy alloy double wall rims and equipped with Kenda Kruiser 24x2.125\" wide tires. A mechanical disc brake set with 160mm rotors has the power to bring the ride to a screeching halt when needed. Stunning good looks, endless versatility, and no shortage of fun. Beasley.",
